---
<section class="py-28 px-6 md:px-16 bg-base border-b border-[#1A2030]">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto">

    <div class="text-slate text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[1.4px] uppercase font-mono mb-6">
      The moment of truth
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-display font-[700] text-[42px] tracking-[-0.8px] leading-[1.1] text-pri mb-14 max-w-[640px]" data-animate>
      When the question comes, there are two answers.
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">

      <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-[#2A3347] bg-surface p-9" data-animate>
        <p class="text-ter text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.3px] leading-[1.35] mb-4">
          "We don't have it yet. We'll keep you posted."
        </p>
        <p class="text-sec text-[15px] leading-[1.65]">
          The deal goes quiet. It signs with whoever had a date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-[14px] border-2 border-accent bg-surface p-9" data-animate>
        <p class="text-pri text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.3px] leading-[1.35] mb-4">
          "Already in progress. Audit booked. Report due in March."
        </p>
        <p class="text-sec text-[15px] leading-[1.65]">
          Security review moves. The deal keeps moving with it.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="text-pri text-[17px] font-semibold text-center" data-animate>
      The difference isn't budget. It's whether you started.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
